{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45101","headline":"与朝阳山人张朝夜集湖亭赋得各言其志 · 皎然","name":"与朝阳山人张朝夜集湖亭赋得各言其志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭孤月在，秋色望无边。\n零露积衰草，寒螿鸣古田。\n茫茫区中想，寂寂尘外缘。\n从此悟浮世，胡爲伤暮年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}